*require 1.4.22
*begin
*case preserve
*truncate off
*set separator :
*set names ._-
*units default
*calibrate default
*sd default
*flags not duplicate not splay not surface
*infer equates off
*infer plumbs off
*infer exports off
*data normal from to tape compass clino
